{"id":"790ab4ebab659823","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-minimum.md","title":"Minimum","display":"df-minimum — Minimum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-minimum","aliases":["58-df-minimum"],"display":"df-minimum — Minimum","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-iota.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-minimum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-minimum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimum — Minimum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a745902a8dccfec\" href=\"?note=5a745902a8dccfec\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-iota.md\">../batch11/58-df-iota.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,m,\\leq\\in V\">\\(A,m,\\leq\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S\\)</span>（集合参数与一元公式模式的元语言关系） (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a745902a8dccfec\" href=\"?note=5a745902a8dccfec\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-iota.md\">../batch11/58-df-iota.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Minimum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Minimum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\leq y\">\\(x\\leq y\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\leq}\">\\(\\min_{\\leq}\\)</span> 是偏函数，定义域为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists m\\;\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\">\\(\\exists m\\;\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；取值图由 Assertion 的等价式给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto\\Phi(x)\">\\(x\\mapsto\\Phi(x)\\)</span> 在该等价式中只表示一元条件模式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum}\\vdash\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(A,\\leq)\\land m\\in A\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;(m\\leq y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum}\\vdash\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(A,\\leq)\\land m\\in A\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;(m\\leq y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\min_{\\leq}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{dom}(\\leq))\\times\\operatorname{dom}(\\leq):\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\min_{\\leq}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{dom}(\\leq))\\times\\operatorname{dom}(\\leq):\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\exists r\\;\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(r,A,\\leq))\\to\n\\bigl(\\min_{\\leq}(A)=m\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S\\!\\left(m,x\\mapsto\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(x,A,\\leq)\\right)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\exists r\\;\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(r,A,\\leq))\\to\n\\bigl(\\min_{\\leq}(A)=m\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S\\!\\left(m,x\\mapsto\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(x,A,\\leq)\\right)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\leq}(A)\">\\(\\min_{\\leq}(A)\\)</span> is defined when the least-element predicate has a witness; antisymmetry makes that witness unique.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-iota.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a745902a8dccfec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-iota.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-iota.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a745902a8dccfec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S$（集合参数与一元公式模式的元语言关系） (see [[../batch11/58-df-iota.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,m,\\leq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Minimum}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\leq y","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists m\\;\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto\\Phi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum}\\vdash\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(A,\\leq)\\land m\\in A\\land\\forall y\\in A\\;(m\\leq y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\min_{\\leq}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{dom}(\\leq))\\times\\operatorname{dom}(\\leq):\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(m,A,\\leq)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimum}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\exists r\\;\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(r,A,\\leq))\\to\n\\bigl(\\min_{\\leq}(A)=m\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IotaTerm}_S\\!\\left(m,x\\mapsto\\mathrm{Minimum}_S(x,A,\\leq)\\right)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min_{\\leq}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-849","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-minimum.md|58-df-minimum]]（batch05）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-74","locatio